cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "sic-mosfet-devsim: DEVSIM-based multi-temperature inverse estimation of process-outcome parameters in 4H-SiC planar MOSFETs"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, frozen configurations, per-run raw data and analysis scripts for a study that
  estimates the JFET width, P-well doping and effective interface charge of a 4H-SiC planar MOSFET
  from DC characteristics simulated with DEVSIM at 300 K and 423 K, evaluates the robustness of the
  multi-temperature gain to high-temperature physics assumptions, and compares adaptive and
  LLM-assisted TCAD sample-selection policies.
authors:
